te Virtual em realidade aumentada ou modo texto, diretamente durante as li\u00e7\u00f5es em realidade virtual.\n\nEsse assistente est\u00e1 sempre dispon\u00edvel para responder perguntas sobre os conte\u00fados das aulas e tamb\u00e9m sobre os produtos do Grupo Plan Marketing, oferecendo suporte inteligente a qualquer momento do treinamento. Uma tecnologia criada para tornar o aprendizado mais acess\u00edvel, din\u00e2mico e envolvente.", "short_description": "Conhe\u00e7a o Assistente Virtual com IA da VRSchool."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_VRschool.png", "id": "1471508504488603", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604298355_1471508507821936_1033407612722260786_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jG0JLFxqWFIQ7kNvwHeHshO&_nc_oc=AdriOSwah_UZjRikLl36aSzvPjMAiSifQdLaeXT6aD4Hs2FZbgJ9Eq2XanFzk30bMv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af788KzTMCq4nervsDiQr4ncb3AVxGwEkhw0QpT0fY74-w&oe=6A11A523"}, {"file_name": "logo_VRSCHOOL.png", "id": "1449776713259284", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1449776716592617_1673567406847786742_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NSKdKW9mm-MQ7kNvwEx3Sbw&_nc_oc=AdowJwE-rX6e9i7Hir9oqeMQoaBBFZ7nMbZ2Wp7LcfyMe3rO_S_4rHGjNqCZdER-kbQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4QISHBUdDEGN_Wt9P1NlWl0oQ3uysDipHvN0SlUFQlTg&oe=6A11AD29"}, {"file_name": "icone_512x512.png", "id": "1278444900874844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_1278444904208177_5391998273224680991_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gnup_uNj7u4Q7kNvwHfQnUA&_nc_oc=Ado9RzeBZcuvEv9U3IGB4hkBr0G3EFJzhXXe_M34XrlRTh3pm1p7JO_it02gJuxQ7ps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4eTSC7ZAELNvAIA4WDWv_Xw0KK_5fx2v2YZaEQbxfRXg&oe=6A11B5